{"id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-iterated-quantifier-block.md","title":"迭代量词块及 FO-VAR","display":"df-iterated-quantifier-block — 迭代量词块及 FO-VAR","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","aliases":["29-df-iterated-quantifier-block"],"display":"df-iterated-quantifier-block — 迭代量词块及 FO-VAR","depends_on":["[[29-df-term-interpretation]]","[[29-df-bit]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-term]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-vocab]]"],"source_locator":"Proviso 1.14, p.13, scan 28; Definition 4.24, p.65, scan 80; Definition 10.14 and Claim 10.19, pp.163–165, scans 178–180","source_basis":"原书文本层；Definition10.14已查看扫描图178；有序对扩张接口为本地显式构造","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iterated-quantifier-block — 迭代量词块及 FO-VAR"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76bbac386a4be5a3\" href=\"?note=76bbac386a4be5a3\" title=\"29-df-term-interpretation\">29-df-term-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f29a2487393d5b9\" href=\"?note=9f29a2487393d5b9\" title=\"29-df-bit\">29-df-bit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Proviso 1.14, p.13, scan 28; Definition 4.24, p.65, scan 80; Definition 10.14 and Claim 10.19, pp.163–165, scans 178–180"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层；Definition10.14已查看扫描图178；有序对扩张接口为本地显式构造"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_q^{(a_q)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_q^{(a_q)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；保留关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},\\mathrm{BIT}\">\\(&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},\\mathrm{BIT}\\)</span> 若在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 中必须为二元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PLUS},\\mathrm{TIMES}\">\\(\\mathrm{PLUS},\\mathrm{TIMES}\\)</span> 必须为三元；保留常元名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,\\max\">\\(0,1,\\max\\)</span> 彼此不同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^\\uparrow\">\\(\\tau^\\uparrow\\)</span> 补入尚未出现的保留符号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 上严格线性序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_U=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\">\\(n_U=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_U:[n_U]\\to|A|\">\\(e_U:[n_U]\\to|A|\\)</span> 是按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 递增的唯一双射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n_U]=\\{0,\\ldots,n_U-1\\}\">\\([n_U]=\\{0,\\ldots,n_U-1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline U,\\overline U\">\\(\\underline U,\\overline U\\)</span>、数值解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf N_U\">\\(\\mathsf N_U\\)</span> 及扩张映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau\">\\(E_\\tau\\)</span> 在下面构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau(U)\">\\(E_\\tau(U)\\)</span> 保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 并按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 解释数值符号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_v=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_v\\}\">\\(X_v=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_v\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_b=\\{b_1,\\ldots,b_b\\}\">\\(B_b=\\{b_1,\\ldots,b_b\\}\\)</span> 是两组不同变量名。域变量取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span>，布尔变量取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(X_v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(X_v)\\)</span> 表示自由变量限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_v\">\\(X_v\\)</span> 的一阶项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau^\\uparrow)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau^\\uparrow)\\)</span> 为扩张词汇的关系符号集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(R)\">\\(a(R)\\)</span> 为元数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下面的公式为二种论域的语法树；关系与域项的相等只作用于域变量，布尔等号只作用于布尔变量或布尔常量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_\\tau\">\\(C_\\tau\\)</span> 是以下给出的域常元名集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma=(\\bar d,\\bar\\epsilon)\\in C_\\tau^v\\times\\mathbb B^b\">\\(\\gamma=(\\bar d,\\bar\\epsilon)\\in C_\\tau^v\\times\\mathbb B^b\\)</span> 指定扩张结构上的初始赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_\\gamma^{E_\\tau(U)}\">\\(\\beta_\\gamma^{E_\\tau(U)}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_2\">\\(\\models_2\\)</span> 的完整二排序语法、赋值和递归语义由本条下式给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{QF},\\mathsf{QB}\">\\(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{QF},\\mathsf{QB}\\)</span> 是下式引入的正式语法集合标识。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\">\\(\\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9f29a2487393d5b9\" href=\"?note=9f29a2487393d5b9\" title=\"29-df-bit\">29-df-bit</a> 的位位置在前、整数在后接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}\">\\(\\mathsf{NR}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NC}\">\\(\\mathsf{NC}\\)</span> 是下式引入的保留符号集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为唯一见证定描述符；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau\">\\(E_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^\\uparrow\">\\(\\tau^\\uparrow\\)</span> 是下式引入的输入类、结构映射和词汇。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,b\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(v,b\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>为定义通用求值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_b\\cap\\mathrm{Var}=\\varnothing\">\\(B_b\\cap\\mathrm{Var}=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B}\">\\(0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> 为与域项不交的布尔常量标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in X_v\\cup B_b\">\\(z\\in X_v\\cup B_b\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\)</span> 属于下面的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{F2}_{\\tau,v,b}\">\\(\\mathsf{F2}_{\\tau,v,b}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathsf{Assgn2}_b(B)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathsf{Assgn2}_b(B)\\)</span>。初始赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_\\gamma^{E_\\tau(U)}\">\\(\\beta_\\gamma^{E_\\tau(U)}\\)</span> 是这种赋值的实例。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}\\coloneqq\\{&lt;^{(2)},\\mathrm{SUC}^{(2)},\\mathrm{BIT}^{(2)},\\mathrm{PLUS}^{(3)},\\mathrm{TIMES}^{(3)}\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{NC}\\coloneqq\\{0,1,\\max\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}\\coloneqq\\{&lt;^{(2)},\\mathrm{SUC}^{(2)},\\mathrm{BIT}^{(2)},\\mathrm{PLUS}^{(3)},\\mathrm{TIMES}^{(3)}\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{NC}\\coloneqq\\{0,1,\\max\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau^\\uparrow\\coloneqq\\tau\\cup\\mathsf{NR}\\cup\\mathsf{NC},\\qquad C_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\}\\cup\\mathsf{NC}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau^\\uparrow\\coloneqq\\tau\\cup\\mathsf{NR}\\cup\\mathsf{NC},\\qquad C_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\}\\cup\\mathsf{NC}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\underline U\\coloneqq e_U(0),\\qquad\\overline U\\coloneqq e_U(n_U-1),\\quad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\underline U\\coloneqq e_U(0),\\qquad\\overline U\\coloneqq e_U(n_U-1),\\quad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf N_U(R)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nL,&amp;R=&lt;,\\\\\n\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j))\\mid i,j\\in[n_U]\\land j=i+1\\},&amp;R=\\mathrm{SUC},\\\\\n\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j))\\mid i,j\\in[n_U]\\land\\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\},&amp;R=\\mathrm{BIT},\\\\\n\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j),e_U(k))\\mid i,j,k\\in[n_U]\\land i+j=k\\},&amp;R=\\mathrm{PLUS},\\\\\n\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j),e_U(k))\\mid i,j,k\\in[n_U]\\land ij=k\\},&amp;R=\\mathrm{TIMES}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf N_U(R)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nL,&amp;R=&lt;,\\\\\n\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j))\\mid i,j\\in[n_U]\\land j=i+1\\},&amp;R=\\mathrm{SUC},\\\\\n\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j))\\mid i,j\\in[n_U]\\land\\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\},&amp;R=\\mathrm{BIT},\\\\\n\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j),e_U(k))\\mid i,j,k\\in[n_U]\\land i+j=k\\},&amp;R=\\mathrm{PLUS},\\\\\n\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j),e_U(k))\\mid i,j,k\\in[n_U]\\land ij=k\\},&amp;R=\\mathrm{TIMES}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf N_U(c)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\underline U,&amp;c=0,\\\\e_U(\\min(1,n_U-1)),&amp;c=1,\\\\\\overline U,&amp;c=\\max.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf N_U(c)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\underline U,&amp;c=0,\\\\e_U(\\min(1,n_U-1)),&amp;c=1,\\\\\\overline U,&amp;c=\\max.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid(\\forall R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\cap\\mathsf{NR}\\;R^A=\\mathsf N_U(R))\\land(\\forall c\\in\\{c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\}\\cap\\mathsf{NC}\\;c^A=\\mathsf N_U(c))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal O_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid(\\forall R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\cap\\mathsf{NR}\\;R^A=\\mathsf N_U(R))\\land(\\forall c\\in\\{c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\}\\cap\\mathsf{NC}\\;c^A=\\mathsf N_U(c))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau:\\mathcal O_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow],\\qquad |E_\\tau(U)|\\coloneqq|A|,\\quad U=(A,L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_\\tau:\\mathcal O_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow],\\qquad |E_\\tau(U)|\\coloneqq|A|,\\quad U=(A,L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^{E_\\tau(U)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathsf N_U(R),&amp;R\\in\\mathsf{NR},\\\\R^A,&amp;R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\setminus\\mathsf{NR},\\end{cases}\\qquad R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau^\\uparrow).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^{E_\\tau(U)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathsf N_U(R),&amp;R\\in\\mathsf{NR},\\\\R^A,&amp;R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\setminus\\mathsf{NR},\\end{cases}\\qquad R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau^\\uparrow).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c^{E_\\tau(U)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathsf N_U(c),&amp;c\\in\\mathsf{NC},\\\\c^A,&amp;c\\in C_\\tau\\setminus\\mathsf{NC},\\end{cases}\\qquad c\\in C_\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c^{E_\\tau(U)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathsf N_U(c),&amp;c\\in\\mathsf{NC},\\\\c^A,&amp;c\\in C_\\tau\\setminus\\mathsf{NC},\\end{cases}\\qquad c\\in C_\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau(U)\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A,\\qquad &lt;^{E_\\tau(U)}=L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_\\tau(U)\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A,\\qquad &lt;^{E_\\tau(U)}=L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(X_v)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}\\mid\\mathrm{var}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(t)\\subseteq X_v\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(X_v)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}\\mid\\mathrm{var}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(t)\\subseteq X_v\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta_\\gamma^{E_\\tau(U)}(x_i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}d_i^{E_\\tau(U)},&amp;1\\leq i\\leq v,\\\\\\underline U,&amp;i\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{1,\\ldots,v\\},\\end{cases}\\qquad\\beta_\\gamma^{E_\\tau(U)}(b_j)\\coloneqq\\epsilon_j,\\quad1\\leq j\\leq b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta_\\gamma^{E_\\tau(U)}(x_i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}d_i^{E_\\tau(U)},&amp;1\\leq i\\leq v,\\\\\\underline U,&amp;i\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{1,\\ldots,v\\},\\end{cases}\\qquad\\beta_\\gamma^{E_\\tau(U)}(b_j)\\coloneqq\\epsilon_j,\\quad1\\leq j\\leq b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}_{\\tau,v,b}\\coloneqq\\{s=t\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(X_v)\\}\\cup\\{R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau^\\uparrow),\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(X_v)^{a(R)}\\}\\cup\\{u=w\\mid u,w\\in B_b\\cup\\{0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B}\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{At}_{\\tau,v,b}\\coloneqq\\{s=t\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(X_v)\\}\\cup\\{R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau^\\uparrow),\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(X_v)^{a(R)}\\}\\cup\\{u=w\\mid u,w\\in B_b\\cup\\{0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B}\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QF}_{\\tau,v,b}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{H\\mid\\mathsf{At}_{\\tau,v,b}\\subseteq H\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in H\\;\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\in H^2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QF}_{\\tau,v,b}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{H\\mid\\mathsf{At}_{\\tau,v,b}\\subseteq H\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in H\\;\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\in H^2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\geq1}(\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\times(X_v\\cup B_b)\\times\\mathsf{QF}_{\\tau,v,b})^s.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\geq1}(\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\times(X_v\\cup B_b)\\times\\mathsf{QF}_{\\tau,v,b})^s.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\exists z.M]\\theta\\coloneqq\\exists z\\,(M\\land\\theta),\\qquad[\\forall z.M]\\theta\\coloneqq\\forall z\\,(M\\to\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\exists z.M]\\theta\\coloneqq\\exists z\\,(M\\land\\theta),\\qquad[\\forall z.M]\\theta\\coloneqq\\forall z\\,(M\\to\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[(q_1,z_1,M_1),\\ldots,(q_s,z_s,M_s)]\\theta\\coloneqq[q_1z_1.M_1]\\cdots[q_sz_s.M_s]\\theta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[(q_1,z_1,M_1),\\ldots,(q_s,z_s,M_s)]\\theta\\coloneqq[q_1z_1.M_1]\\cdots[q_sz_s.M_s]\\theta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[QB]^0\\theta\\coloneqq\\theta,\\qquad[QB]^{r+1}\\theta\\coloneqq[QB]([QB]^r\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[QB]^0\\theta\\coloneqq\\theta,\\qquad[QB]^{r+1}\\theta\\coloneqq[QB]([QB]^r\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\{U\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau\\mid E_\\tau(U)\\models_2[QB]^{c\\,t(n_U)}\\theta[\\beta_\\gamma^{E_\\tau(U)}]\\}\\ \\middle|\\ b\\in\\mathbb N,\\ c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\ QB\\in\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b},\\ \\theta\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{\\tau,v,b},\\ \\gamma\\in C_\\tau^v\\times\\mathbb B^b\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FO\\!\\operatorname{-}\\!VAR}[t,v,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\{U\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau\\mid E_\\tau(U)\\models_2[QB]^{c\\,t(n_U)}\\theta[\\beta_\\gamma^{E_\\tau(U)}]\\}\\ \\middle|\\ b\\in\\mathbb N,\\ c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\ QB\\in\\mathsf{QB}_{\\tau,v,b},\\ \\theta\\in\\mathsf{QF}_{\\tau,v,b},\\ \\gamma\\in C_\\tau^v\\times\\mathbb B^b\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{F2}_{\\tau,v,b}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{H\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathsf{At}_{\\tau,v,b}\\subseteq H\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in H\\;\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\in H^2\\land\\forall\\phi\\in H\\;\\forall z\\in X_v\\cup B_b\\;\\forall Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\;Qz\\,\\phi\\in H\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{F2}_{\\tau,v,b}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{H\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathsf{At}_{\\tau,v,b}\\subseteq H\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in H\\;\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\in H^2\\land\\forall\\phi\\in H\\;\\forall z\\in X_v\\cup B_b\\;\\forall Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\;Qz\\,\\phi\\in H\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Assgn2}_b(B)\\coloneqq\\{\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\cup B_b\\to|B|\\cup\\mathbb B\\mid\\beta[\\mathrm{Var}]\\subseteq|B|\\land\\beta[B_b]\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad D_z^B\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}|B|,&amp;z\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\\\\\mathbb B,&amp;z\\in B_b.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Assgn2}_b(B)\\coloneqq\\{\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\cup B_b\\to|B|\\cup\\mathbb B\\mid\\beta[\\mathrm{Var}]\\subseteq|B|\\land\\beta[B_b]\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad D_z^B\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}|B|,&amp;z\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\\\\\mathbb B,&amp;z\\in B_b.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[a/z](y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;y=z,\\\\\\beta(y),&amp;y\\neq z,\\end{cases}\\qquad a\\in D_z^B,\\quad y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\cup B_b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[a/z](y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;y=z,\\\\\\beta(y),&amp;y\\neq z,\\end{cases}\\qquad a\\in D_z^B,\\quad y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\cup B_b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_2^{B,\\beta}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}u^B[\\beta\\upharpoonright\\mathrm{Var}],&amp;u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(X_v),\\\\\\beta(u),&amp;u\\in B_b,\\\\0,&amp;u=0_{\\mathbb B},\\\\1,&amp;u=1_{\\mathbb B}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_2^{B,\\beta}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}u^B[\\beta\\upharpoonright\\mathrm{Var}],&amp;u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau^\\uparrow}(X_v),\\\\\\beta(u),&amp;u\\in B_b,\\\\0,&amp;u=0_{\\mathbb B},\\\\1,&amp;u=1_{\\mathbb B}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\models_2(s=t)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_2^{B,\\beta}(s)=\\operatorname{val}_2^{B,\\beta}(t),\\qquad B\\models_2 R(\\bar t)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bar t^B[\\beta\\upharpoonright\\mathrm{Var}]\\in R^B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\models_2(s=t)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_2^{B,\\beta}(s)=\\operatorname{val}_2^{B,\\beta}(t),\\qquad B\\models_2 R(\\bar t)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bar t^B[\\beta\\upharpoonright\\mathrm{Var}]\\in R^B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\models_2(\\neg\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(B\\models_2\\phi[\\beta]),\\qquad B\\models_2(\\phi\\circ\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((B\\models_2\\phi[\\beta])\\circ(B\\models_2\\psi[\\beta])),\\quad\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\models_2(\\neg\\phi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(B\\models_2\\phi[\\beta]),\\qquad B\\models_2(\\phi\\circ\\psi)[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((B\\models_2\\phi[\\beta])\\circ(B\\models_2\\psi[\\beta])),\\quad\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\models_2\\exists z\\,\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in D_z^B\\;B\\models_2\\phi[\\beta[a/z]],\\qquad B\\models_2\\forall z\\,\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in D_z^B\\;B\\models_2\\phi[\\beta[a/z]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\models_2\\exists z\\,\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in D_z^B\\;B\\models_2\\phi[\\beta[a/z]],\\qquad B\\models_2\\forall z\\,\\phi[\\beta]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in D_z^B\\;B\\models_2\\phi[\\beta[a/z]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 4.24，印刷页 65，扫描页 80，及 Definition 10.14，印刷页 163，扫描页 178。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"QB,\\theta,b,c,\\gamma\">\\(QB,\\theta,b,c,\\gamma\\)</span> 对每个查询固定，只有重复次数随结构大小变化；布尔变量不计入域变量数。重复时保留变量名的重新绑定，不先把每一份块都改成互不相同的变量。查询由初始赋值封闭，相当于原书最后的常量替换。</p>\n<p>输入接口补记：有序输入保持为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\">\\(U=(A,L)\\)</span>；满足关系实际作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau(U)\">\\(E_\\tau(U)\\)</span>。若基础词汇已有序或端点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau\\)</span> 要求其与给定序相容，因此扩张保留全部基础解释，且每个保留符号仅有一次解释。新语法使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^\\uparrow\">\\(\\tau^\\uparrow\\)</span>，使保护公式确实能够调用内建序和端点。单元素结构允许两个不同常元名取同一个端点。</p>\n<p>本轮按原书 Proviso 1.14（印刷13页、扫描28）补齐标准数值关系与常元；Claim 10.19（印刷164–165页、扫描179–180）在保护式中直接使用 SUC，精确 VAR 变量界不能暗中用多变量的 FO 展开替代。数值关系不作为独立建议输入，已有同名符号必须与序编号解释一致。库中 BIT 的参数次序与原书相反：这里的 BIT(i,j) 对应书中的 BIT(j,i)。n=1 时 SUC、BIT 为空，0=1=max；这是明确的小域约定。初始元组改记为 d，避免与输入词汇中的 c_i 混同。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"76bbac386a4be5a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bit","status":"resolved","id":"9f29a2487393d5b9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bit]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"575d9a1532e3c73b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","a